# Keep the release archive loadable for consumers: tests/ (install_smoke) and
# tools/ load dev-only modules (rules_itest, rules_kind, rules_helm), which a
# consumer can't see, so `bazel query @rules_alertmanager//...` would fail on
# them. GitHub's tag tarballs honour export-ignore. (A git_override clone
# still has them.)
tests/ export-ignore
tools/ export-ignore
